# Pharmacy Management System - User Stories

## Product Backlog

### US01 - Secure Login

As a pharmacy staff member, I want to log into the system securely, so that only authorized users can access pharmacy information.

### US02 - Medicine Management

As a pharmacist, I want to add, update, and remove medicine records, so that the medicine catalog remains accurate.

### US03 - Inventory Monitoring

As a pharmacist, I want to view current medicine quantities, so that I can monitor available inventory.

### US04 - Low Stock Alerts

As a pharmacist, I want to receive low stock alerts, so that medicines can be reordered before they run out.

### US05 - Medicine Search

As a pharmacy staff member, I want to search for medicines by name or category, so that I can quickly find required medicine information.

### US06 - Prescription Management

As a pharmacist, I want to record and manage customer prescriptions, so that prescription information can be maintained accurately.

### US07 - Sales and Billing

As a cashier, I want to process medicine sales and generate bills, so that customers can receive accurate purchase records.

### US08 - Supplier Management

As a pharmacy manager, I want to manage supplier information, so that medicine suppliers can be tracked and contacted when stock needs replenishment.

### US09 - Sales and Inventory Reports

As a pharmacy manager, I want to view sales and inventory reports, so that pharmacy performance and stock levels can be monitored.

### US10 - Staff Account and Role Management

As an administrator, I want to manage staff accounts and access roles, so that system permissions can be controlled appropriately.
